      "libraries": [
        {
          "entries": [
            {
              "def": "M3",
              "metric": {
                "aliases": [
                  "门店退货率(%)",
                  "store return rate"
                ],
                "basis": {
                  "kind": "explicit_question",
                  "task": "M3-L1"
                },
                "caveats": [
                  "必须使用 store_sales LEFT JOIN store_returns，否则无退货的销售行会被丢掉，分母变小并导致退货率被高估；已验证该关联下约 60.41% 的 store_sales 行没有匹配退货。",
                  "退货按小票号+商品与销售行对应，已验证该组合为 1:1，因此不需要额外去重即可保证每笔退货只计一次。",
                  "期间按销售日期（store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk → date_dim）归属，不是按退货日期归属。",
                  "口径未提及 sr_status 过滤，因此所有匹配到的退货记录均计入。"
                ],
                "definition": "期间内按销售日期归属的门店销售行，其对应退货金额（sr_return_amt）之和 ÷ 这些销售行的净支付额（ss_net_paid）之和 × 100；退货按小票号和商品与销售行对应，每笔退货只计一次。",
                "empty": "unspecified",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "question": "2001 年 2 月的门店退货率是多少？口径：门店退货率（%）= 期间内售出的门店销售行所对应的退货金额（sr_return_amt）之和 ÷ 这些销售行的净支付额（ss_net_paid）之和 × 100；按销售日期归属期间，退货按小票号和商品与销售行对应，每笔退货只计一次。保留两位小数。",
                    "sql": "WITH sales AS (\n  SELECT ss.ss_ticket_number, ss.ss_item_sk, ss.ss_net_paid\n  FROM store_sales ss\n  JOIN date_dim d ON ss.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\n  WHERE d.d_year = 2001 AND d.d_moy = 2\n)\nSELECT\n  ROUND(SUM(sr.sr_return_amt) / SUM(s.ss_net_paid) * 100, 2) AS return_rate_pct\nFROM sales s\nLEFT JOIN store_returns sr\n  ON s.ss_ticket_number = sr.sr_ticket_number\n AND s.ss_item_sk = sr.sr_item_sk"
                  }
                ],
                "fact": "store_sales",
                "filters": {},
                "grain": [
                  "ss_ticket_number",
                  "ss_item_sk"
                ],
                "joins": [
                  {
                    "cardinality": "1:1",
                    "filters": {},
                    "key": "join:store_returns|store_sales",
                    "kind": "left",
                    "left": "store_sales",
                    "loss_ratio": 0.604122,
                    "on": [
                      [
                        "ss_ticket_number",
                        "sr_ticket_number"
                      ],
                      [
                        "ss_item_sk",
                        "sr_item_sk"
                      ]
                    ],
                    "revision": 0,
                    "right": "store_returns"
                  }
                ],
                "measure": "sum(sr_return_amt) / sum(ss_net_paid) * 100",
                "name": "门店退货率",
                "time": {
                  "dim": "date_dim",
                  "dim_col": "d_date_sk",
                  "fact_col": "ss_sold_date_sk",
                  "grain": "day",
                  "loss_ratio": 0.010305000000000009,
                  "role": "销售日"
                }
              },
              "name": "门店退货率"
            },
            {
              "def": "M3",
              "metric": {
                "aliases": [
                  "门店退货率（%）"
                ],
                "basis": {
                  "kind": "explicit_question",
                  "task": "M3-L2"
                },
                "caveats": [
                  "退货关联使用 LEFT JOIN，未退货的销售行保留用于分母；已验证关联中 store_sales 到 store_returns 为 1:1，匹配率约 39.59%（loss_ratio 0.604122），不会因一对多退货重复放大分母。",
                  "期间过滤按 store_sales 的销售日期（经 date_dim）归属，不按退货日期归属。",
                  "题面未要求按 sr_status 过滤退货状态；链中未过滤 sr_status。"
                ],
                "definition": "期间内售出的门店销售行所对应退货金额（sr_return_amt）之和，除以这些销售行的净支付额（ss_net_paid）之和，再乘以100。按销售日期归属期间；退货通过小票号和商品键关联到对应销售行，每笔退货只计一次。",
                "empty": "unspecified",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "question": "2000 年 7 月的门店退货率是多少？口径：门店退货率（%）= 期间内售出的门店销售行所对应的退货金额（sr_return_amt）之和 ÷ 这些销售行的净支付额（ss_net_paid）之和 × 100；按销售日期归属期间，退货按小票号和商品与销售行对应，每笔退货只计一次。保留两位小数。",
                    "sql": "WITH sales AS (\n  SELECT ss.ss_ticket_number, ss.ss_item_sk, ss.ss_net_paid\n  FROM store_sales ss\n  JOIN date_dim d ON ss.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\n  WHERE d.d_year = 2000 AND d.d_moy = 7\n)\nSELECT\n  ROUND(SUM(sr.sr_return_amt) / SUM(s.ss_net_paid) * 100, 2) AS return_rate_pct\nFROM sales s\nLEFT JOIN store_returns sr\n  ON s.ss_ticket_number = sr.sr_ticket_number\n AND s.ss_item_sk = sr.sr_item_sk"
                  }
                ],
                "fact": "store_sales",
                "filters": {},
                "grain": [
                  "ss_ticket_number",
                  "ss_item_sk"
                ],
                "joins": [
                  {
                    "cardinality": "1:1",
